            "review_title": "Review at SASHIMI BBQ GARDEN",
            "review_text": "lanletuyet\nHanoi, Vietnam43 contributions\n0\nGood :D\nSep 2015\nVery good space! They have an Asian style garden which blooms with flowers (i dont know the name of the plant but it has flowers all year round). Good settings and lighting (not too much light like most fast food restaurant). Really good and welcoming services. They have open kitchen in the middle of the hall. Ingredients are really fresh and well marinated. The dipping sauce are a bit lack of taste, and one of their 2 salads are a bit too salty for me. I ordered the 249k buffet set today.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 16, 2015",
